1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,540
By the second winter he quit bringing the clipboard

2
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:06,420
Started showing up with coffee, two cups, black

3
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:09,940
Said, "I've ridden a thousand years and never met a fella

4
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:12,980
Who looks me in the eye and says thank you back"

5
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:16,500
I said, "Every time you knock, I hold my people longer

6
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:19,220
Every time you sit, I say the things I should

7
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:22,660
Guess you're the reason that I'm living like I mean it

8
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:26,740
Funny how the darkest rider did me some good"

9
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:33,780
Truth is, friend, we all hold a ticket of our own

10
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:42,180
And the number on the paper is a number no one's shown

11
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:45,380
So hug 'em at the door, and say it while they're near

12
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:49,060
Don't wait to start your living, friend, the living's right here
